WEBVTT

00:08:28.916 --> 00:08:31.596
And it takes energy to cook wood
and to grind rock,

00:08:31.596 --> 00:08:33.916
and so all of those approaches
I’m talking about

00:08:33.916 --> 00:08:37.036
are currently much more expensive
than planting trees.

00:08:38.676 --> 00:08:40.516
But we can do something about that.

00:08:40.956 --> 00:08:42.516
We can invest in it now,

00:08:42.516 --> 00:08:43.996
do the research and development

00:08:43.996 --> 00:08:46.676
and get them down the cost curve
to make them affordable.

00:08:46.716 --> 00:08:47.996
It worked for solar power;

00:08:47.996 --> 00:08:49.116
it worked for wind;

00:08:49.116 --> 00:08:50.916
it can work for carbon removals, too.

00:08:51.796 --> 00:08:55.036
Remember, we have to get
to very big scale:

00:08:55.036 --> 00:08:58.276
billions of tonnes
of carbon removals by 2050.

00:08:58.676 --> 00:09:03.156
But we can all help by reducing
our emissions as much as possible